# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stembox patch workspace — ignore rules
#
# This repository is ONLY the patch toolkit for Stembox:
#   /apply_patches.py  the single toolkit: patch / keys / mint / install / status
#   /patch.md          technical documentation
#   /README.md         usage notes
#   /build/            ALL intermediate artifacts (git-ignored, disposable)
#
# /source/ is a SEPARATE project (the open-source reimplementation, "ostem").
# It is intentionally ignored here: versioned on its own, not part of this repo.
#
# Everything under build/ is reproducible:
#   build/app-pristine/  vendor DMG contents (re-download; see patch.md §5)
#   build/app-patched/   patched + signed output of `apply_patches.py patch`
#   build/keys/          our Ed25519 keypair (PRIVATE KEY — never commit)
#   build/models/        separation weights (~460MB)
#   build/downloads/     vendor DMGs
#   build/cmake/         cmake -S source -B build/cmake
#   build/venv/          python -m venv build/venv
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# NOTE: source/ is a git SUBMODULE (the ostem project) — do not ignore it here.
#   .gitmodules -> source = https://github.com/esanle/ostem.git
# Clone with:  git clone --recurse-submodules <this repo>

# build tree (intermediates, incl. the private key)
build/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# CMake / native
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
compile_commands.json

# downloaded / generated model weights (huge, reproducible)
*.onnx

# macOS
.DS_Store
*.swp

# secrets: never commit key material or tokens (they live under build/ anyway)
*.hex
keys.json
token_*.txt
*_token*.txt

# editors
.idea/
.vscode/
